  STATUS Orbiting Saturn
  ELEMENTS 120502527.1 0.005829978 28.052253 169.525414 169.525414 169.525414 57897.25
  AROT 0.0 0.0 0.0
  PRPLEVEL 0:1.000 1:1.000
  NAVFREQ 0 0 0 0
  GEAR 0 0.0000
  AAP 0:0 0:0 0:0
END
